 "subject": "Housing finance and development: Sacramento Regional Housing and Homelessness Joint Powers Authority Act.",
 "title": "An act to add Article 1.5 (commencing with Section 6539.9.5) to Chapter 5 of Division 7 of Title 1 of the Government Code, relating to housing.",
